---
<section id="comparison" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white border-b border-zinc-200 scroll-reveal">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="text-left sm:text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-sky-700 font-semibold mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>The Economic Comparison</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-zinc-950 tracking-tight">
        Why SaaS Leaders Choose the Async Model
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white shadow-2xs">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-sm text-zinc-700 border-collapse">
        <thead>
          <tr class="border-b border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50">
            <th class="py-4 px-4 font-semibold text-zinc-700">Criteria</th>
            <th class="py-4 px-4 font-semibold text-zinc-700">Full-Time W-2 SDET</th>
            <th class="py-4 px-4 font-semibold text-zinc-700">Legacy A11y Agency</th>
            <th class="py-4 px-4 font-bold text-white bg-zinc-950 font-mono">avilano.dev</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-zinc-200 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <tr>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 font-sans font-semibold text-zinc-950">Cost &amp; Commitment</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-600">$180k-$220k/yr + Equity</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-600">$30k-$75k per static audit</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-950 font-bold bg-sky-50/70 border-l border-zinc-200">$5,495/mo (Pause/Cancel anytime)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 font-sans font-semibold text-zinc-950">Time to Start</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-600">2-4 months recruiting</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-600">3-6 weeks RFP process</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-emerald-800 font-bold bg-sky-50/70 border-l border-zinc-200">Under 48 hours</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 font-sans font-semibold text-zinc-950">Code Deliverables</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-600">Writes code internally</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-rose-700 font-medium">✗ Only 100-page PDF reports</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-emerald-800 font-bold bg-sky-50/70 border-l border-zinc-200">✓ Direct PRs &amp; CI pipeline code</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 font-sans font-semibold text-zinc-950">CI Automated Gates</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-600">Often struggles with flakiness</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-rose-700 font-medium">✗ None (Manual audit only)</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-emerald-800 font-bold bg-sky-50/70 border-l border-zinc-200">✓ Sub-3min Playwright + Axe CI</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 font-sans font-semibold text-zinc-950">Management Overhead</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-600">High (1:1s, reviews, benefits)</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-600">Weekly vendor status calls</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 text-emerald-800 font-bold bg-sky-50/70 border-l border-zinc-200">Zero (100% Async + 2-min Looms)</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
